---
title: CI/CD Pipeline Flow
---
graph LR
    A[👨‍💻 Developer Push] --> B[GitHub Actions CI]
    B --> C{Tests Pass?}
    C -->|No| D[❌ Pipeline Failed\nNotify Developer]
    C -->|Yes| E[Build Docker Image\nmulti-stage Dockerfile]
    E --> F[Security Scan\nTrivy + kubesec]
    F --> G{Vulnerabilities?}
    G -->|CRITICAL| D
    G -->|Clean| H[Push to GHCR\nghcr.io/Parzivalart3mis/image:SHA]
    H --> I[Update k8s/overlays/dev\nkustomize edit set image]
    I --> J[Git Commit\nchore: update dev images to SHA]
    J --> K[ArgoCD Detects\nPolls Git every 3 min]
    K --> L[Diff: Desired vs Actual]
    L --> M{Out of Sync?}
    M -->|No| N[✅ Already in sync]
    M -->|Yes| O[Sync: kubectl apply]
    O --> P[Rolling Update\nmaxUnavailable=0]
    P --> Q[Health Checks\nliveness + readiness probes]
    Q --> R[✅ Deployed to Dev]
    R --> S[Promote?\nmanual workflow dispatch]
    S --> T[k8s/overlays/staging\npromote.yml updates tag]
    T --> U[Manual ArgoCD Sync\nfor staging]
    U --> V[✅ Deployed to Staging]
    V --> W[Promote to Prod?\nmanual approval]
    W --> X[k8s/overlays/prod\npromote.yml updates tag]
    X --> Y[Manual ArgoCD Sync\nfor prod]
    Y --> Z[✅ Deployed to Production]

    style A fill:#4f46e5,color:#fff
    style D fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style N fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style R fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style V fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style Z fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style J fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style K fill:#6366f1,color:#fff
